{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2022-02-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON TO SEEK PROJECT CANARY CERTIFICATION OF SELECT NORTH AMERICAN UPSTREAM ASSETS', 'text': "HOUSTON & DENVER--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHEVRON CORPORATION (NYSE: CVX) ANNOUNCED TODAY A PILOT PROJECT WITH PROJECT CANARY TO INDEPENDENTLY CERTIFY OPERATIONAL AND ENVIRONMENTAL PERFORMANCE IN THE COMPANY'S NORTH AMERICAN UPSTREAM REGION. “CHEVRON IS FOCUSED ON DELIVERING RELIABLE, LOWER CARBON ENERGY TO A GROWING WORLD. WE AIM TO ACHIEVE THIS THROUGH INNOVATION, BOTH IN OUR APPLICATION OF TECHNOLOGY, AND IN OUR APPROACH TO HOW WE DESIGN AND RUN OUR OPERATIONS,” SAID STEVE GREEN, PRESIDENT, CHEVRON"}